{
  "name": "Projects",
  "description": "Work with a goal and a target date, inside one product.",
  "position": 1,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "start-project",
      "label": {
        "en": "Start a new project",
        "zh-CN": "新建一个项目"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-rnd` skill in this folder, then the `rnd-pmo` skill, and follow them. Create the project I describe under the right product, with an owner, a start and a target date, and a goal written as what users will be able to do when it is done.",
        "zh-CN": "{target}\n\n先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-rnd` Skill，再读 `rnd-pmo` Skill，按它们的流程做。在对应产品下新建我描述的项目：写上负责人、开始和目标日期，目标要写成「做完后用户能做什么」。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "update-project",
      "label": {
        "en": "Update this project's progress and health",
        "zh-CN": "更新这个项目的进展和健康度"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-rnd` skill in this folder, then the `rnd-pmo` skill, and follow them. Read this project's tasks, changes and deliveries from the last week, then write a two-sentence latest update and set health by the playbook's rules. Tell me why if health changes.",
        "zh-CN": "{target}\n\n先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-rnd` Skill，再读 `rnd-pmo` Skill，按它们的流程做。读这个项目最近一周的任务、变更和交付，写两句话的最新进展，并按手册规则设置健康度。健康度有变化时告诉我原因。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "projects-at-risk",
      "label": {
        "en": "Which projects are at risk, and why?",
        "zh-CN": "哪些项目有风险，原因是什么"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-rnd` skill in this folder, then the `rnd-pmo` skill, and follow them. List the projects that are at risk or off track, with the overdue or blocked tasks behind each one. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "{target}\n\n先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-rnd` Skill，再读 `rnd-pmo` Skill，按它们的流程做。列出有风险或已延误的项目，以及每个项目背后超期或卡住的任务。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
